WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.247 --> 00:00:01.152
- Nice to meet you.

00:00:01.152 --> 00:00:02.359
You look like you're
going to give me trouble,

00:00:02.359 --> 00:00:03.988
so I'll much sure yours is the only name

00:00:03.988 --> 00:00:05.123
I memorize this week.

00:00:05.123 --> 00:00:10.023
(fast-paced techno music)

00:00:10.023 --> 00:00:11.927
- You don't have to come to my prom later.

00:00:11.927 --> 00:00:14.388
The leftovers are my groceries anyways.

00:00:14.388 --> 00:00:15.411
- I can tell that you're drunk,

00:00:15.411 --> 00:00:17.243
but we don't technically
have a policy against it

00:00:17.243 --> 00:00:18.755
so I'm pretending not to notice

00:00:18.755 --> 00:00:20.007
so I don't have to document it.

00:00:20.007 --> 00:00:21.655
- When I'm doing room inspections,

00:00:21.655 --> 00:00:23.515
I'm judging you by the stuff you have.

00:00:23.515 --> 00:00:25.347
(speaks foreign language)

00:00:25.347 --> 00:00:27.182
- I'm only asking for
your ID so that you know

00:00:27.182 --> 00:00:28.507
I'm documenting this.

00:00:28.507 --> 00:00:29.850
I pretty much have your information

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:30.966
memorized by now.

00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:32.639
- Please just take these condoms now.

00:00:32.639 --> 00:00:35.958
So we don't have to have that
awkward conversation later.

00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:37.330
- I know who you are

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:38.862
and I've told you so many times

00:00:38.862 --> 00:00:40.022
to keep your ID with you,

00:00:40.022 --> 00:00:40.812
I'm just gonna let you sit out there

00:00:40.812 --> 00:00:41.625
for a little while.

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:43.254
- I have three papers due tomorrow.

00:00:43.254 --> 00:00:45.181
Do you really think I want
to write this report as well.

00:00:45.181 --> 00:00:48.114
- I really don't agree with
your side of the argument

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:51.193
but I have to act impartial so
just keep spouting nonsense.

00:00:51.193 --> 00:00:53.097
- Love the dorm. Drink in your room.

00:00:53.097 --> 00:00:54.861
It really doesn't bother me.

00:00:54.861 --> 00:00:56.996
But if you mess with my door tags,

00:00:56.996 --> 00:00:58.253
then it's on.

00:00:58.253 --> 00:01:03.253
(fast-paced techno music)

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.776
(swishing)

00:01:05.776 --> 00:01:07.865
(light piano music)

00:01:07.865 --> 00:01:09.837
- It's just so sad what's
happening over there.

00:01:09.837 --> 00:01:11.325
- Oh yeah, hm mm. (swoshing)

00:01:11.325 --> 00:01:13.724
(swishing)
(quick pop)

00:01:13.724 --> 00:01:16.722
(quick swish) You don't
know the half of it.

00:01:16.722 --> 00:01:18.530
(light piano music)

